1
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,222
On my command.

2
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:06,945
Four hundred!

3
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:08,511
We're only sixty.

4
00:00:08,925 --> 00:00:09,745
Not the gate,

5
00:00:10,265 --> 00:00:11,193
the canal head.

6
00:00:11,947 --> 00:00:13,196
Four hundred or not,

7
00:00:13,255 --> 00:00:14,725
they take that canal.

8
00:00:14,798 --> 00:00:16,326
Village defense mission:

9
00:00:16,396 --> 00:00:19,158
no woman or child lost.

10
00:00:19,908 --> 00:00:20,684
Lime sacks,

11
00:00:20,743 --> 00:00:21,899
one every three paces.

12
00:00:21,966 --> 00:00:23,797
Pits this shallow?

13
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,066
No need.

14
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,170
A stumble's enough.

15
00:00:26,227 --> 00:00:26,797
Front row, down!

16
00:00:27,111 --> 00:00:29,441
Nobody moves till I call.

17
00:00:29,511 --> 00:00:31,427
Xiaotang, the women and kids are yours.

18
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:32,483
And where will you be?

19
00:00:32,708 --> 00:00:33,652
Get down.

20
00:00:33,714 --> 00:00:35,598
People die up here.

21
00:00:35,699 --> 00:00:36,821
I'm staying here,

22
00:00:36,879 --> 00:00:38,165
with you.

23
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:40,873
Charge!

24
00:00:40,934 --> 00:00:42,622
The grain's all ours!

25
00:00:43,002 --> 00:00:43,391
Wait.

26
00:00:44,202 --> 00:00:44,902
Throw!

27
00:00:50,202 --> 00:00:51,042
What is this!

28
00:00:53,694 --> 00:00:55,561
Every torch is out!

29
00:00:59,989 --> 00:01:01,443
Where's Brother?

30
00:01:01,734 --> 00:01:02,786
One comes in,

31
00:01:02,898 --> 00:01:03,716
one goes down.

32
00:01:03,774 --> 00:01:04,820
Get out!

33
00:01:09,374 --> 00:01:11,351
Not one got in!

34
00:01:13,451 --> 00:01:14,750
Master Diao Qi's blade,

35
00:01:14,807 --> 00:01:15,753
Out of my way!

36
00:01:16,074 --> 00:01:16,658
Blade,

37
00:01:16,764 --> 00:01:17,449
down.

38
00:01:22,715 --> 00:01:23,571
Tie him up!

39
00:01:23,656 --> 00:01:24,759
Into the granary!

40
00:01:24,821 --> 00:01:26,221
You didn't hide.

41
00:01:26,496 --> 00:01:27,527
Said I'd stay with you.

42
00:01:27,786 --> 00:01:30,905
Qin Shuang: affection forty-eight.

43
00:01:30,988 --> 00:01:32,700
Mission complete.

44
00:01:33,333 --> 00:01:34,256
Brother!

45
00:01:36,933 --> 00:01:37,571
Xiaohe?

46
00:01:37,792 --> 00:01:38,319
Xiaohe!
